From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "guoping.liu" <guoping.liu@3reality.com>
Date: Mon, 3 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] add ThirdReality HubV3A support (1GB RAM)

HubV3A is a cost-reduced variant:
- 1GB RAM
- No Thread UART
- Zigbee only

---
